WEBVTT

00:01:28.971 --> 00:01:31.031
no one hugged me,

00:01:31.031 --> 00:01:33.401
no one counseled me,

00:01:33.401 --> 00:01:36.341
no one told me I would be okay.

00:01:36.341 --> 00:01:39.265
No one told me that I would live in fear,

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.878
that I would become paranoid,

00:01:41.878 --> 00:01:44.871
or that I would react hyper-violently

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.249
to being shot.

00:01:47.249 --> 00:01:50.070
No one told me that one day,

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:54.127
I would become the person behind the trigger.

00:01:54.127 --> 00:01:56.801
Fourteen months later,

00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:59.411
at 2 a.m.,

00:01:59.411 --> 00:02:01.047
I fired the shots